title: "VIGILANCE"
abstract: "The human concentrated where they have value, the system vigilant everywhere. A method corpus for the economy of human attention in AI-assisted work: explicit versioned rules of normal, total verification by the system, human judgment on exceptions only, with published health measures and a pre-registered invalidation criterion."
